      "writtenOn": "2015-03-13T15:30:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the patch get merged you may assign a remote_id_attribute per protocol but the current one is still valid. However, to use the new one I think you have to patch the code first and then the documentation. So if this guideline has to reflect the current websso implementation I think this is OK and when/if the other patch is merged you have to change the code and the doc.",
